#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md:1
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "掩膜"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md:3
msgid ""
"Masking the observed spectrum is supported in `solve`.  The code will "
"then allocate the corresponding pixel to different mask, and perform "
"different manupulation to them."
msgstr ""
"`solve` 支持对观测光谱应用掩膜。程序会将对应的像素分配到不同的掩膜类别，并对它们执行不同的处理。"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md:6
msgid ""
"The mask, `sme.mask` is an array with `dtype=int` with the same length "
"with `sme.wave`. The types of mask are:"
msgstr ""
"掩膜 `sme.mask` 是一个 `dtype=int` 的数组，其长度与 `sme.wave` 相同。掩膜类型如下："

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "mask value"
msgstr "掩膜值"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "mask name"
msgstr "掩膜名称"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "bad pixel"
msgstr "坏像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "Pixels excluded"
msgstr "被排除的像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "line pixel"
msgstr "谱线像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "Pixels included in the parameter fitting"
msgstr "参与参数拟合的像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "continuum pixel"
msgstr "连续谱像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "Pixels included in continuum fitting"
msgstr "参与连续谱拟合的像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "vrad pixel"
msgstr "vrad 像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md
msgid "Pixels included in radial velocity fitting"
msgstr "参与径向速度拟合的像素"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md:16
msgid ""
"The masks are additive, i.e., you can set mask value to 5 for line and "
"vrad pixel. Only the good pixels will be included in the fit, but the "
"synthetic spectrum will still be calculated."
msgstr ""
"这些掩膜值是可叠加的。例如，你可以把某个像素的掩膜值设为 5，表示它同时是谱线像素和 vrad 像素。只有有效像素会参与拟合，但合成光谱仍会照常计算。"

#: ../../fundamentals/mask.md:18
msgid "In default, mask is all 1."
msgstr "默认情况下，掩膜全为 1。"
